Carry On for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.3.0)

A port of Carry On 2.1.2.7 by Tschipp, Purplicious_Cow, cy4n.
Original source: https://github.com/Tschipp/CarryOn
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the original's LICENSE_carryon (GNU LGPL v3); COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on.
